{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49882","headline":"木兰花 · 庾传素","name":"木兰花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"木兰红艳多情态，不似凡花人不爱。\n移来孔雀槛边栽，折向凤皇钗上戴。\n是何芍药争风彩，自共[牡]丹长作对。\n若教爲女嫁东风，除却黄莺难匹配。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庾传素","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49882.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49882","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}